# Build context is the repository root. Patterns need **/ to apply below it:
# the previous file's `node_modules/` and `.env` matched only at the root, so
# apps/*/node_modules and apps/backend/.env (with its secrets) were sent into
# every build.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.log
**/.e2e-fixtures
apps/backend/storage
apps/backend/.file-storage
.git
.github
docs
**/*.md
.vscode
.idea
**/.DS_Store
